@startuml
title MaintainIQ Katmanları
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

component "MaintainIQ.UI\nWinForms + DevExpress" as UI
component "MaintainIQ.Services\nKullanım senaryoları" as Services
component "MaintainIQ.Data\nADO.NET + Dapper" as Data
component "MaintainIQ.Domain\nSaf OOP ve iş kuralları" as Domain
database "SQL Server" as Db

UI --> Services
Services --> Data
Services --> Domain
Data --> Domain
Data --> Db

note bottom of Domain
  Başka projeye veya altyapı
  paketine bağımlı değildir.
end note
@enduml

